5-iw1y7mbxf","summary":"Weekly iOS development newsletter featuring urgent security updates for zero-click vulnerabilities, articles on Swift global actors and AI features using Foundation Models, discussions about iOS app development complexity, and trending Swift libraries including Metal-powered video upscaling, workspace managers, and SwiftUI camera implementations.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--HRgLpUt6--/f_auto/v1722860399/public/Placeholder%2003","num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2025-08-28T21:48:02.456Z"},{"id":"xwCyON2gc","title":"Awesome iOS Weekly - Issue 477, Aug 21, 2025","url":"https://ios.libhunt.com/newsletter/477","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/awesome-ios-weekly---issue-477-aug-21-2025-xwcyon2gc","summary":"Weekly iOS development newsletter featuring AI integration with Foundation Models, security patches for zero-day vulnerabilities, upcoming RCS encryption between iOS and Android, trending Swift libraries for speech processing and AI agents, and Xcode extensions for GitHub Copilot integration.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--VDukGCjf--/f_auto/v1722860399/public/Placeholder%2002","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2025-08-21T20:05:37.428Z"},{"id":"2Zb0KVEMn","title":"Awesome iOS Weekly - Issue 476, Aug 14, 2025","url":"https://ios.libhunt.com/newsletter/476","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/awesome-ios-weekly---issue-476-aug-14-2025-2zb0kvemn","summary":"Weekly iOS development newsletter featuring major news about GPT-5 integration with Apple Intelligence in iOS 26, curated Swift libraries and projects, and trending development tools. Highlights include OpenAI's GPT-5 coming to iOS and macOS platforms, popular Swift libraries for iOS development, and various utility apps for Mac users including caps lock optimization and temporal dithering control.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--ZrL_HSsR--/f_auto/v1722860399/public/Placeholder%2006